<title>USA: Merchants Banc reinstates div at $0.10/shr.</title>
<headline>Merchants Banc reinstates div at $0.10/shr.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Vt. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchants Bancshares Inc Tuesday said it has reinstated its dividend and has declared a fourth quarter dividend of $0.10 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on February 14, 1997 to shareholders of record on February 4, 1997.</p>
<p>The company last payed a dividend in April 1993. The dividend was $0.20 per chare.</p>
